Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven appears to be there after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And that place is at Cape Canaveral\NSpace Center, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,At the beginning of\Neverything, there was gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the friend who was\Naiding Jolene in prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So if he punches us won't be in big trouble\Nthat's why whenever his stance fists
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,make contact with something it'll be\Ninverted and I don't know how far but with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,everything sideways we're just gonna\Nkeep falling so this is it thanks to the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,unique energy around Cape Canaveral the\Npriest has somehow developed a new stand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for human beings to attain happiness\Nthey must first overcome their destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and the obstacles Dio and I must overcome\NAre you damn Joestars in your bloodline?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart has been turned inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't working before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this text be from...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is Mr. Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, you've got to find Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that Jolene is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart should have\Nbeen turned inside out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Joestar bloodline is something I\Nmust overcome, no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to protect Jolene, I'm gonna\Nhave to kill that fucking priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:03:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But all the future will\Nbe the same as the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire of the world will
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,be the same as the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I'm well aware that she doesn't\Nhave the capability to move her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is she still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.04,0:04:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I somehow miss her\Nvital points by accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt, I hit her heart dead on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have turned inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be the Joestar bloodline\Nand the blood of that damn Kujo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what's trying to hinder the plan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,that Dio and I have\Nbeen working to achieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that I end Jolene Kujo\Nhere, no matter what lengths I must go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the times Jolene has\Ninterfered with my plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,within the prison and in Orlando,\Nhave been tests on my path to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Father Pucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the one who walks the\Npath with fate on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Our plan goes beyond\Npetty feelings of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio and I will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a soul in the world\Ncapable of getting in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simply inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I could really use a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my hip bone's pretty messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you call an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It is close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The place where Jolene\Nfell should be around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a scrap of Jolene's clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning it's likely that she wound\Nup falling into this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the fool sneaking up behind\Nme, I suggest you not come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not consider you a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even pose a threat to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back, Seamoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not an Estacia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver Drive can phase into more than\Njust walls in the ground, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He was one of the tourists who\Ndied from your gravity ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I changed his bone structure from\Nthe inside and turned him into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're already within my range.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.34,0:07:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Driver, drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned himself inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,To me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,your significance is\Neven less than Sun Wukong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,as he bounced around in the Buddha's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:07:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something just touched my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Jolene Kujo's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What on God's green earth is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How is she still able to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have suffered a grave injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is telling me that I must\Npursue her with everything I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to end her permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Given that he'll be\Nlooking for his daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that Jotro Kujo\Nwill be arriving here any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And it will be a real\Nnuisance if Anastasia regains
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,his composure and tries\Nto come for me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that everyone is gathering to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,this location in order\Nto protect Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is the case, what's most significant\Nright now is that you perish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They all believe in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but it is your death that will shatter the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,hearts of everyone who\Nis heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially Jotaro will\Nbe losing his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be enough to strip him of his
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,reason to live and the\Nstrength in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He will no longer be a\Nthreat to either me or Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be now, in this very place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find you no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Jolene and Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just her strings!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, she's behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to devote my entire being\Nto snuffing out your life right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already aware you've\Nsuffered a severe injury!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The gravity pulls in the opposite\Ndirection of wherever my feet are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything falls towards me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I got you with a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now both of your arms are as good as gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of her arms should\Nhave been inverted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Jolene Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attempts to stop me are futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy Mother of God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that shape in her chest\Nwhere her heart should be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Mobius Strip!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what you're creating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You start by tracing the\Nsurface with your finger
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.98,0:12:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and from there keep\Ngoing if you continue to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,trace without ever lifting\Nyour finger from the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,surface you realize that\Nyou've somehow ended up on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the other side but after\Ngoing around the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,length of it you find\Nyourself back at the starting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,point this shape with no\Nfront side or backside
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,was discovered in the\N19th century by a German
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mathematician in honor of\Nhim, the shape was dubbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the mobius strip in\Norder for it to invert it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,would need more than one\Nsurface but it has no
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,concept of inside or outside\Nthe shape known as the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,band of infinity she was\Nable to make one with
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,her thread but there's\Nonly one possible moment
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,where she could have made\Nit and that's the very
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,moment when sea moon struck\Nher in the heart with
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the first person to have\Never eaten a mushroom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,has my respect it might\Nhave been poisonous you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,know was it just some\Nlucky fool that happened
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,to eat it and everything\Nturned out to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,was it a final act of desperation fueled\Nby hunger that spurred this discovery?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's test a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take a direct blow to your\Nbrain, can you still stay alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But from which direction\Nshall I strike you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a single blow to your\Nhead is all that it would take.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're coming at me, you better\Ngive it your all till the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm biding my\Ntime for the perfect moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To assure my survival,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been observing you closely\Nas I circle around and corner you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for the precise moment that\NI shall finally achieve victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As I continue to walk\Naround you in circles,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,all kinds of various objects will begin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,falling into place in\Nthe area surrounding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:15:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for my fated moment\Nof victory to gravitate toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With those dire wounds and\Nthe Mobius Strip you've made,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll be able to avoid it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I've been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The corpse of the security guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And his gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Raid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Courtesy of the Speedwagon Foundation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,they fired the spear from three\Nkilometers up in the air and managed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to drive it straight into the\Nground here at the Visitor's Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Using my stand smack,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it so the one spear split into two,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and when I peeled the sticker off, it\Ntried its best to come back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I held on to the spear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,it still pulled me three\Nkilometers towards the other spear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,at an extremely fast rate,\Nregardless of gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the same principle to get here\Nby dividing the spear a few more times,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,all while following where he\Nsensed that Jolene was located.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, Code, and Hermes\Nmade it at the last second!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We've finally got you\Nsurrounded, Father Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea that your stand\Nwill reach its completed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,state in 36 hours is just\Nyour twisted fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any more\Nallies to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And you won't ever be\Nable to see the new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is truly on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And is serving me with one last test.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To prove my worthiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What I thought was a hindrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Became exactly what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, the Joestar bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is here to lend me aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.82,0:17:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After my body was forcefully\Nthrown into this frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally saw the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That the Kujos have been\Nmy allies all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is that damn priest\Nfloating up towards the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:18:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said before, gravity is\Nworking with me as its center.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand everything\Nnow, Dio. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I no longer need to wait for the\Nnew moon to arrive in 36 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If what I require for this\Nto work is the gravitational
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,effect which is created\Nduring the new moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then all I have to do is\Nstay afloat and keep rising
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,until I can discover those\Nexact gravitational conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And from there, I'll have found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The spot with the same\Npole as the new moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for my sea\Nmoon to become complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.22,0:18:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,there must be an optimal position\Nwith which it'll activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're gonna let you get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep struggling all you want, but\Nthis is over for you, Poochie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Locate the right position.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down by counting the prime numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirteen, seventeen, nineteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch is mumbling\Nsomething under his breath up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.72,0:18:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His gravity hasn't changed yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's still being\Npulled parallel to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hermes, take a look at the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab that gun he dropped earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've grown so much, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold tightly to the railing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up that gun, and take the shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Seamoooon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Start Platinum the World!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were a baton man, I'd say you're gonna\Nuse your stand to deflect those bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But time has been stopped\Nfor a total of five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't even be able to\Nsee this spear coming at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When time goes back to normal, that\Nspear will fly straight through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.84,0:20:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more seconds, two\Nseconds, one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now time will resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened\Nthe spear missed its mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He moved slightly during the time stop
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It failed he's still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's opening the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.64,0:20:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's trying to\Nget inside the space shuttle
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and now this thing is\Nstarting to float in the air, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest is taking shelter in\Nthe goddamn display space shuttle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He managed to avoid the spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.22,0:21:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's just\Ntrying to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be. Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he have discovered something\Nthat's giving him the advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he actually find the missing\Nelement to complete his ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the ones who have been\Nhelping to raise me up all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were in prison, you\Nhave been there, lending me aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Father who art in heaven, I\Nbeseech you to lead and guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you to please watch over me, so\NI may not walk down the wrong path!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It is to your very will that\NI shall dedicate myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The coordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.46,0:22:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:23:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.64,0:23:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.02,0:23:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
